The title sentence-casing algorithm in src/sentence.rs is a Rust port of the
implementation in @retorquere/bibtex-parser (sentence-case.js and the
sentence-casing/guess logic in index.js, as of v7.0.5), and is therefore a
derivative of that work. https://github.com/retorquere/bibtex-parser

